Latke - recipe from Yael 18dec99

2 1/2 lbs baking potatos
1         large onion
1         egg
2 T       flour  
1 T       parsley
1 T       lemon juice
1/2 t     baking powder
1/2 t     salt
1/4 t     black pepper
3/4 cup   oil for frying

Peel and shred potatoes and onion finely.
Squeeze by hand to remove as much water as
you can.  Mince Parsley fine.  Mix every-
thing together.  Fry in 3 T oil till brown
and crispy.  Drain on paper towels & eat
with sour cream and Apple sauce.

This recipe will serve two adults and two
kids just about right.

Use more parseley for taste but the color
gets a little weird.

Use more pepper.


